{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/963861-fading-suns-victory-points-system-to-storyteller-system-thoughts-please","id":963861,"title":"Fading Suns Victory Points System to Storyteller System - thoughts, please","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-05T13:00:23-07:00","id":963861,"title":"Fading Suns Victory Points System to Storyteller System - thoughts, please","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> So I'm a big fan of Fading Suns, which has lots of similarities with the Storyteller System. The VPS system kinda feels like the writers (many of them WW writers at the time) wanted to use Storyteller, so made a similar system, replacing successes with victory points, Attributes for Characteristics and Humanity for the Spirit Characteristics. VPS is also a pretty clunky system. So, with that in mind, I've made my own VPS to STS conversion, and I'd like some feedback.<br /> <br /> Here it is: <a href=\"https://www.evernote.com/shard/s246/sh/bdc1fa50-ab5c-4d16-9a67-04a0782f5763/e9139ab5b368c2e78d36d01d7d3b530b\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.evernote.com/shard/s246/...36d01d7d3b530b</a><br /> <br /> The conversion uses Sorcerer Revised Psychic Phenomena for Psi, Paths and Rituals for Theurgy, and True Faith in general (a simpler system for priests than Paths and Rituals, and perhaps more appropriate for some character concepts too). Cybernetics are used as per the Enhancements Background in M20, with cyborgs taking flaws instead of permanent Paradox. There's also a simple system for converting existing VPS characters to STS, as well as a character creation system using only STS rules (there's a core template with 'race' packages you buy as Merit/Flaws, based on the net impact to characters).<br /> <br /> I also simplified the Hubris and Urge systems, but ditched all the paired Spirit stats otherwise. Enhancements cause problems when the dots exceed your Charisma (signifying machine versus soul). Wyrd points are of course subsumed into Willpower, as is Inciting Passion. Most Skills convert easily to Abilities, if necessary, and Benefices/Afflictions to Backgrounds/negative Backgrounds, and Blessings/Curses to Merits/Flaws.<br /> <br /> Anyone care to take a look and offer any feedback/suggestions/comments?<br /> <br /> Does anyone here play FS?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T11:24:13-07:00","id":964418,"title":"","content":"No, but now I am kind of nosy about it...<br /> Great, yet another RPG I am interested in with the challenge to find the people and time to try it out...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T01:58:48-07:00","id":964858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_